    <item>
      <title>Landfall 0.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:44:04 -0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202610131343</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/seamoss/Landfall/releases/tag/v0.6.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Automatic updates</b> with Sparkle: Landfall checks once a day for signed, notarized updates from GitHub, notifies you without interrupting, and offers &quot;Update to …&quot; in the menu. Settings › General › Updates has the switches and a Check Now button. Install this version manually once; later versions arrive by themselves.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
